cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite the dataset and the date of the edition or reading you used."
type: dataset
title: "The Buildout Ledger: the AI Buildout Ledger and the Tokenization Buildout Ledger"
abstract: >-
  Two sourced, self-updating ledgers. The AI Buildout Ledger records who pays whom to build AI across
  applications, models, infrastructure, chips and energy. The Tokenization Buildout Ledger records tokenized
  money and assets: what is outstanding on chain, who issues it, where it settles and what backs it. Every row
  carries its source, a grade, an as-of date and a definition; an independent check runs against each row's
  source, and history is append-only. Frozen editions are kept unchanged for citation.
authors:
  - given-names: Derek
url: "https://buildoutledger.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/3nchiridion/buildout-ledger"
keywords:
  - tokenization
  - stablecoins
  - real-world assets
  - tokenized money market funds
  - tokenized stocks
  - AI infrastructure
  - AI investment
  - open data
